Instant Pot Perfect Brown Rice (2 Cups)
Ingredients
2 cups brown rice (long-grain, short-grain, or brown jasmine)

2 cups water or stock

½ tsp salt (optional)

1 tsp olive oil or butter (optional, helps prevent foaming)

Instructions
Rinse: Place 2 cups of brown rice in a fine-mesh strainer and rinse under cold water until clear. Drain thoroughly.

Combine: Add rinsed rice, 2 cups water/broth, salt, and oil/butter into the Instant Pot inner pot. Stir once to submerge all rice grains.

Pressure Cook: Lock the lid, set the valve to Sealing, and cook on High Pressure for 15 minutes.

Natural Release: Allow pressure to release naturally for 10 to 15 minutes before opening the valve.

Fluff: Quick release any remaining steam, open the lid, and fluff with a fork.

